{"title":"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Last year a bicycle cost &#36;160 and a cycling helmet &#36;40. This year the cost of the bicycle increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbf33b81900fa9e836a608be7484b4c4d6ea3ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" />, and the cost of the helmet increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. The percent increase in the combined cost of the bicycle and the helmet is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/2/da2254b99cd8810b8c8e2f125c875c316ce7be8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 6\\%\\quad \\text{(B) } 7\\%\\quad \\text{(C) } 7.5\\%\\quad \\text{(D) } 8\\%\\quad \\text{(E) } 15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the bicycle originally cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2678b3b55414f1afe2988d22f5bb250c9ec75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$160$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" />, the new cost will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b578e93cc347e3f150027cc2bf885366656fec43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$160 \\times 5\\% = 160 \\times \\frac{1}{20} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"205\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b308fc43c6d9ab5f69f186bb341c07c6af0d0052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$160 + 8 = 168$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" />. The new cost of the helmet will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a1c31abdc3b9aa81048bff57556d5d9f8288349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 \\times 10\\% = 40 \\times \\frac{1}{10} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"196\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71ab047e63f53a58675607e3d304358c3eecaae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 + 4 = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d43db8ad74c5d503eb9b00e36dd4d2088ced97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$160 + 40 = 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c849c389b1d49f4c4808232cd5f9cd314141de44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$168 + 44 = 212$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />, so the total percent increase is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f038013f9a9cbc5cb205223785dac7bdd5d308eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{200} = 6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME\" title=\"1993 AHSME\">1993 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Pr